 "name": "Microsoft Cloud Security",
 "description": "At Microsoft Cloud Security Practice our main goal is to work along with our customers on planning cloud security strategies, architectures and remediation processes; conduct security and control risk assessments when required; and build, test and deploy business continuity and security solution plans, on cloud, on-premises and hybrid, through Microsoft Cloud & Security solutions (Azure, Entra ID, Microsoft 365, Purview, Intune, Defender…). We also handle third-party vendors such as Symantec, Trend Micro, Cisco, Okta, Palo Alto and Fortinet, but our main focus is Microsoft tools and technologies. We design and lead strategic projects, and we also join teams as support / implementation engineers. Roles we provide: Cloud Security Engineers, Infrastructure Engineers, Technical Project/Program Managers, Sysadmins, Identity Managers and Data/Information Protection Engineers. We take part in migrations from on-premises to cloud or hybrid. We are now seeking to focus on Azure AI security and other AI security vendors such as Claude Code security.",
